       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             SPMWOGEN.
       AUTHOR.                 W. ROXBURY.
       INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
      *REMARKS.           **** INITIATE PREVENTATIVE MAINTENANCE
      *                        MASTER WORKORDERS
      *                        ****.
      *C************************************************************************
      *C***  PLANNER/ENGINEER/SCHEDULER VALIDATION CHECK REMOVED PER         ***
      *C***  NAPANEE/DANVILLE REQUEST OUT OF THE PM SEMINAR IN NAPANEE IN    ***
      *C***  OCT. 1992                     WDR  OCT. 19, 1992                ***
      *C************************************************************************
      *C***  ADDED ABILITY TO INPUT EXPENSE CLASS WHEN GENERATING A NEW      ***
      *C***  PM MASTER WORKORDER - REQUEST# 6313 - WDR 11/18/92              ***
      *C************************************************************************
      *C***  CHANGED PROGRAM TO RETAIN WORKORDER DATA ON SCREEN BUT BLANKING ***
      *C***  ONLY EQUIPMENT NAME FOR MULTIPLE SIMILAR WORKORDERS.  F5 KEY    ***
      *C***  WILL CLEAR SCREEN.    REQUEST# 6547 - WDR 11/08/94              ***
      *C************************************************************************
      *C***  REMOVED CALLS TO BUDGET CONTROL SYSTEM                          ***
      *C***                        REQUEST# 6609 - WDR 06/27/96              ***
      *C************************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.          I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN       TO WORKSTATION-ZPMMAINT-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS MODE  IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS  IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT PM-JOBPLAN
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM4101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                               WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

           SELECT EQP-EQUIPMENT
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

           SELECT PER-PERSONNEL
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0301
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

           SELECT MVALIDPLTDATA
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

           SELECT PM-MSTR-SCHED
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM4301
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                               WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC         PIC X(2000).

       FD  PM-JOBPLAN
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD.
       01  PM-JOBPLAN-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM4101.

       FD  EQP-EQUIPMENT
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD.
       01  EQP-EQUIPMENT-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM0201.

       FD  PER-PERSONNEL
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD.
       01  PER-PERSONNEL-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM0301.

       FD  MVALIDPLTDATA
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD.
       01  MVPD-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1701.

       FD  PM-MSTR-SCHED
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD.
       01  PMS-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM4301.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  DISPLAY-STATUS      PIC X(2).
       77  PRINT-SW  VALUE 0   PIC S9(4)  COMP.
       77  CFT-BUF             PIC XX.
       77  ANSWER-FIELD        PIC X.
       77  DISP-DOTS           PIC X(40)  VALUE ALL "*".
       77  ERROR-SW            PIC 9      VALUE 0.
       77  CRAFT-SW            PIC 9      VALUE 0.
       77  CONDIT-CODE         PIC X.
       77  QUEUE-PRTY          PIC 9.
       77  QUEUE-SW            PIC X.
       77  QUEUE-ERROR         PIC X(76).
       77  CC-CTR              PIC 9      VALUE 0.
       77  CC-KEY              PIC X(04).
       77  EQP-NUM-KEY         PIC X(06).
       77  MVALPLT-DATA        PIC X(30)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  WO-ADD-SAVE         PIC X(10)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  ERROR-SWITCH        PIC S9(4)  COMP.
       77  WORK-ORDER-NUMBER   PIC X(10).
       77  RETURN-COD          PIC S9(4)  COMP.
       77  SCREEN-SAVE         PIC X(1000).

       01  PASSWORD-INFORMATION.
           05  NAME-OF-PROGRAM PIC X(08) VALUE "SPMWOGEN".
           05  PROGRAM-TYPE    PIC X(02) VALUE "UP".
           05  PROGRAM-RELEASE PIC X(12) VALUE " J0100010001".
           05  PROGRAM-DESCRIPTION.
               10  PROG-DESC-A PIC X(60) VALUE
           "THIS IS THE PM WORKORDER MASTER INITIATE PROGRAM FOR THE  ".
               10  PROG-DESC-B PIC X(60) VALUE
           "MMIS PREVENTIVE MAINTENANCE SYSTEM.                       ".
               10  PROG-FUNC   PIC X(60) VALUE
           "RUNS OUT OF PROGRAM TPMMAINT.                             ".
           05  PASSWORD-FLAG   PIC X.

       01  FILE-STAT.
           05  FILE-STAT-1     PIC X(1).
           05  FILE-STAT-2     PIC X(1).

       01  SRF-INDICATORS.
           05  IND             OCCURS 99 TIMES PIC 1 INDICATOR 01.

       01  CURDATE-BUFF.
           05 Y-BUFF           PIC 9(2).
           05 M-BUFF           PIC 9(2).
           05 D-BUFF           PIC 9(2).

       01  TODAYS-DATE.
           05  TD-CT           PIC 99.
           05  TD-YY           PIC 99.
           05  TD-MM           PIC 99.
           05  TD-DD           PIC 99.

       01  TIME-BUF.
           05  TIME-HHMM       PIC 9(04).
           05  TIME-REST       PIC 9(04).

       01  SCREEN-BUFFER.
           05  REQR-BUF        PIC X(16).
           05  EQP-NUM-BUF     PIC X(06).
           05  MSTR-SCH-BUF    PIC X(10).
           05  JP-KEY-BUF      PIC X(10).
           05  REQST-BUF       PIC X(12).
           05  BUDGET-BUF      PIC X(16).
           05  EXPCLS-BUF.
               10  ECB         OCCURS 8 TIMES PIC X.
           05  PLNR-BUF        PIC X(04).
           05  ENGR-BUF        PIC X(04).
           05  SCHD-BUF        PIC X(04).
           05  WO-DESC-BUF     PIC X(30).
           05  DESC-2-BUF      PIC X(66).
           05  DESC-3-BUF      PIC X(66).
           05  MSG-BUF         PIC X(70).
           05  CMDMSG          PIC X(79).
           05  ERRMSG          PIC X(79).

       01  ARG-DEFN.
           05  ARG-F2          PIC X(02).
           05  FILLER          PIC X(08).

       01  WS-CONTROL.
           02  FUNCTION-NUM    PIC X(2).
               88  ENTER-USED              VALUE "00".
               88  F1-KEY-USED             VALUE "01".
               88  F2-KEY-USED             VALUE "02".
               88  F3-KEY-USED             VALUE "03".
               88  F4-KEY-USED             VALUE "04".
               88  F5-KEY-USED             VALUE "05".
               88  F6-KEY-USED             VALUE "06".
               88  F7-KEY-USED             VALUE "07".
               88  F8-KEY-USED             VALUE "08".
               88  F9-KEY-USED             VALUE "09".
           02  TERMINAL-ID     PIC X(10).
           02  FORMAT-NAME     PIC X(10).

       01  COM-BUFF.
           05  CFT-SW          PIC X(02)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER          PIC X(348) VALUE SPACES.

       01  DB-ADD-MSG.
           05  DB-ADD-1.
               10  FILLER      PIC X(14) VALUE SPACES.
           05  DB-ADD-2.
               10  FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.
               10  WO-ADD      PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
               10  FILLER      PIC X(34) VALUE SPACES.

       01  TIME-BUFFER.
           05  CUR-TIME.
               10  CUR-HRS     PIC XX.
               10  CUR-MINS    PIC XX.
           05  CUR-SECS        PIC XX.

       01  RETURN-ERROR.
           05  ERROR-TEXT      PIC X(68).
           05  ERROR-NUM       PIC X(08).
           05  ERROR-CODE      REDEFINES ERROR-NUM
                               PIC ZZZZZZZ9.

       01  WHO-VARIABLES.
           05  USERNAME        PIC X(10).
           05  TERMNUM         PIC X(10).
           05  CURLIB          PIC X(10).
           05  JOBLIBX         PIC X(1).

       01  DB-ERROR.
           05  DB-TYPE         PIC X(08) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER          PIC X(14) VALUE "FILE-STATUS = ".
           05  CON-WORD        PIC XX.

           COPY IOFEEDBACK     IN COPYLIB.

           COPY CATREAD        IN COPYLIB.

           COPY DBSTAT         OF COPYLIB.

       01  MESSAGE-FILE-DATA.  COPY ERRORLIN OF COPYLIB.

       01  WO-EQP-DATA.        COPY MEQPFILE OF COPYLIB.

       01  WO-PLANNED-DATA.    COPY DWOPLAN  OF COPYLIB.

       01  PERSONNEL-DATA.     COPY MPERSONL OF COPYLIB.

       01  WO-TRACK-DATA.      COPY DWOTRACK OF COPYLIB.

       01  PM-JOBPLAN-DATA.    COPY DPMJBPLN OF COPYLIB.

       01  PM-AUDIT-DATA.      COPY DPMAUDIT OF COPYLIB.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  DBPARAMETERS.       COPY DBPARMS  OF COPYLIB.

           COPY VCOMLINK       OF COPYLIB.

           COPY LANGSUB        OF COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION      USING DBPARAMETERS
                               VIEW-COMAREA
                               LANGUAGE-PARMS.
       BEGIN.
           OPEN I-O            DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT          PM-JOBPLAN.
           OPEN INPUT          PM-MSTR-SCHED.
           OPEN INPUT          EQP-EQUIPMENT.
           OPEN INPUT          PER-PERSONNEL.
           OPEN INPUT          MVALIDPLTDATA.

           MOVE SPACES         TO WO-TRACK-DATA.
           CALL "CLWHO"        USING USERNAME TERMNUM CURLIB JOBLIBX.

           MOVE USERNAME       TO USER-NAME.
           MOVE TERMNUM        TO USER-TERM.
           MOVE "SPMWOGEN"     TO PROGRAM-NAME.

           ACCEPT CURDATE-BUFF FROM DATE.
           MOVE Y-BUFF         TO TD-YY.
           MOVE M-BUFF         TO TD-MM.
           MOVE D-BUFF         TO TD-DD.
           MOVE 20             TO TD-CT.
           IF TD-YY > 70
               MOVE 19         TO TD-CT.

           CALL "TPWORD" USING PASSWORD-INFORMATION.
           IF PASSWORD-FLAG = "N"
               GO TO 2-EOJ.

           ACCEPT TIME-BUFFER  FROM TIME.
           MOVE SPACES         TO SCREEN-BUFFER SCREEN-SAVE.
           MOVE "VPMWOGEN"     TO VIEW-NFNAME.

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE SPACES         TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           MOVE SCREEN-SAVE    TO SCREEN-BUFFER.
           MOVE SPACES         TO EQP-NUM-BUF.
           IF BUDGET-BUF = SPACES
               MOVE "   -  -  -   R  " TO BUDGET-BUF.

           IF WO-ADD-SAVE NOT = SPACES
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 049/015:
      ** WORK ORDER {        } ENTERED IN DATABASE
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  49        TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  15        TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE ERRMSG     TO DB-ADD-2
               MOVE SPACES     TO ERRMSG
               MOVE WO-ADD-SAVE TO WO-ADD
               MOVE DB-ADD-MSG TO MSG-BUF.

       61-SHOWFORM.
           MOVE SCREEN-BUFFER  TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC   FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0"       TO SRF-INDICATORS.

           READ DISPLAY-FILE   FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK   FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3          TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
               MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO SCREEN-BUFFER SCREEN-SAVE.
           MOVE B"1"           TO IND(33).

           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 8 OR VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 2-EOJ.

           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 5
               MOVE SPACES     TO SCREEN-SAVE
               MOVE ALL B"0"   TO SRF-INDICATORS
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(11)
               GO TO 6-MAIN.

       61-EDIT-CHECKS.
           IF REQR-BUF = SPACES
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 044/028:
      ** REQUESTER REQUIRED
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  44        TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  28        TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE ALL B"0"   TO SRF-INDICATORS
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(11)
               MOVE 1          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           IF EQP-NUM-BUF = SPACES
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 031/016:
      ** EQUIPMENT NUMBER IS REQUIRED
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  31        TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  16        TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE ALL B"0"   TO SRF-INDICATORS
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(33)
               MOVE 3          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           MOVE EQP-NUM-BUF    TO EQPNUM OF EQP-EQUIPMENT.
           READ EQP-EQUIPMENT  INTO WO-EQP-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/004:
      ** INVALID EQUIPMENT NUMBER
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  35        TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE   4        TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE ALL B"0"   TO SRF-INDICATORS
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(33)
               MOVE 3          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           MOVE MSTR-SCH-BUF   TO PMSCHEDKEY OF PM-MSTR-SCHED.
           MOVE "01"           TO PMLEVEL    OF PM-MSTR-SCHED.
           READ PM-MSTR-SCHED
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 39 / 54:
      ** MASTER SCHEDULE MUST BE CREATED PRIOR TO MASTER WORKORDER
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE 39         TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE 54         TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE ALL B"0"   TO SRF-INDICATORS
               MOVE 5          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.


           MOVE JP-KEY-BUF     TO PMJOBPKEY OF PM-JOBPLAN.
           START PM-JOBPLAN    KEY = PMJOBPKEY OF PM-JOBPLAN
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 36 / 13:
      ** JOBPLAN MUST BE CREATED PRIOR TO MASTER WORKORDER
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE 36         TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE 13         TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE ALL B"0"   TO SRF-INDICATORS
               MOVE 4          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           IF EXPCLS-BUF = SPACES
               MOVE EQP-EXP-CLASS TO EXPCLS-BUF.

           IF ECB(8) = " "
             IF ECB(7) = " "
               IF ECB(6) = " "
                 IF ECB(5) = " "
                   IF ECB(4) = " "
                     IF ECB(3) = " "
                       IF ECB(2) = " "
                         MOVE ECB(1)     TO ECB(8)
                         MOVE "0"        TO ECB(7) ECB(6)
                                            ECB(5) ECB(4)
                                            ECB(3) ECB(2)
                                            ECB(1)
                       ELSE
                       MOVE ECB(2)       TO ECB(8)
                       MOVE ECB(1)       TO ECB(7)
                       MOVE "0"          TO ECB(6) ECB(5)
                                            ECB(4) ECB(3)
                                            ECB(2) ECB(1)
                     ELSE
                     MOVE ECB(3)         TO ECB(8)
                     MOVE ECB(2)         TO ECB(7)
                     MOVE ECB(1)         TO ECB(6)
                     MOVE "0"            TO ECB(5) ECB(4)
                                            ECB(3) ECB(2)
                                            ECB(1)
                   ELSE
                   MOVE ECB(4)           TO ECB(8)
                   MOVE ECB(3)           TO ECB(7)
                   MOVE ECB(2)           TO ECB(6)
                   MOVE ECB(1)           TO ECB(5)
                   MOVE "0"              TO ECB(4) ECB(3)
                                            ECB(2) ECB(1)
                 ELSE
                 MOVE ECB(5)             TO ECB(8)
                 MOVE ECB(4)             TO ECB(7)
                 MOVE ECB(3)             TO ECB(6)
                 MOVE ECB(2)             TO ECB(5)
                 MOVE ECB(1)             TO ECB(4)
                 MOVE "0"                TO ECB(3) ECB(2)
                                            ECB(1)
               ELSE
               MOVE ECB(6)               TO ECB(8)
               MOVE ECB(5)               TO ECB(7)
               MOVE ECB(4)               TO ECB(6)
               MOVE ECB(3)               TO ECB(5)
               MOVE ECB(2)               TO ECB(4)
               MOVE ECB(1)               TO ECB(3)
               MOVE "0"                  TO ECB(2) ECB(1)
             ELSE
             MOVE ECB(7)                 TO ECB(8)
             MOVE ECB(6)                 TO ECB(7)
             MOVE ECB(5)                 TO ECB(6)
             MOVE ECB(4)                 TO ECB(5)
             MOVE ECB(3)                 TO ECB(4)
             MOVE ECB(2)                 TO ECB(3)
             MOVE ECB(1)                 TO ECB(2)
             MOVE "0"                    TO ECB(1).

           MOVE EXPCLS-BUF     TO ARG-DEFN.
           MOVE "EC"           TO ARG-F2.
           MOVE ARG-DEFN       TO VALDTAKEY OF MVALIDPLTDATA.
           READ MVALIDPLTDATA  INTO MVALPLT-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE "NW"       TO ARG-F2
               MOVE ARG-DEFN   TO VALDTAKEY OF MVALIDPLTDATA
               READ MVALIDPLTDATA INTO MVALPLT-DATA
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT
               END-READ
               IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/009:
      ** INVALID EXPENSE CLASS
      **********************************************************************
                   MOVE 35     TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 09     TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS
                   MOVE 31     TO FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 65-ERROR
                   GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

       61-CONTINUE-EDIT-CHECKS.
           MOVE 0              TO CC-CTR.
           MOVE "00"           TO FILE-STAT.
           IF PLNR-BUF NOT = SPACES
               MOVE PLNR-BUF   TO CC-KEY
               ADD 1           TO CC-CTR
               PERFORM 65-CHECK-CC.

           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/047:
      ** INVALID CLOCK CARD NUMBER
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE 35         TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE 47         TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE ALL B"0"   TO SRF-INDICATORS
               MOVE 15         TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           MOVE "00"           TO FILE-STAT.
           IF ENGR-BUF NOT = SPACES
               MOVE ENGR-BUF   TO CC-KEY
               ADD 1           TO CC-CTR
               PERFORM 65-CHECK-CC.

           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/047:
      ** INVALID CLOCK CARD NUMBER
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE 35         TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE 47         TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE ALL B"0"   TO SRF-INDICATORS
               MOVE 16         TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           MOVE "00"           TO FILE-STAT.
           IF SCHD-BUF NOT = SPACES
               MOVE SCHD-BUF   TO CC-KEY
               ADD 1           TO CC-CTR
               PERFORM 65-CHECK-CC.

           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/047:
      ** INVALID CLOCK CARD NUMBER
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE 35         TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE 47         TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE ALL B"0"   TO SRF-INDICATORS
               MOVE 17         TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           IF CC-CTR = 0
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 041/009:
      ** ONE OR MORE OF PLANNER, ENGINEER AND SCHEDULER MUST BE SELECTED
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  41        TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE   9        TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE ALL B"0"   TO SRF-INDICATORS
               MOVE 15         TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           IF WO-DESC-BUF = SPACES
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 030/042:
      ** DESCRIPTION REQUIRED
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  30        TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  42        TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE ALL B"0"   TO SRF-INDICATORS
               MOVE 18         TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

       62-PREV-WRITE.
           CALL "TNEWWONU"     USING DBPARAMETERS
                               STATUS-AREA
                               WORK-ORDER-NUMBER
                               ERROR-SWITCH.

           IF ERROR-SWITCH NOT = 0
               MOVE SPACES     TO DB-TYPE
               MOVE ERROR-SWITCH TO CON-WORD
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               DISPLAY DISP-DOTS
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "  PLEASE NOTIFY MMIS SYSTEM MANAGER OR"
               DISPLAY "  HP SYSTEM OPERATOR OF THE FOLLOWING:"
               DISPLAY "  PROGRAM NAME:  SPMWOGEN OF XPMMAINT"
               DISPLAY "  SUBROUTINE:    TNEWWONU"
               DISPLAY "  " DB-ERROR
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY DISP-DOTS
               DISPLAY "    "
               MOVE SPACES     TO WO-ADD-SAVE
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           MOVE SPACES         TO WO-PLANNED-DATA.
           MOVE WORK-ORDER-NUMBER TO WO-NUM-PLANNED.
           MOVE "000"          TO WO-NUM-SUFF-P.
           MOVE WO-NUM-PLANNED TO WO-NUM-TRACK WO-ADD-SAVE
                                  WORK-ORDER-NUMBER.
           MOVE "OO"           TO WO-STATUS-P
                                  WO-STATUS-TRACK
                                  TRANS-STATUS.
           MOVE TODAYS-DATE    TO DATE-RECD-P-CN DATE-STAMP-CN.
           MOVE CUR-TIME       TO TIME-RECD-P TIME-STAMP.
           MOVE "U"            TO APPROVAL-CODE-P.
           MOVE REQR-BUF       TO REQUESTER-P.
           MOVE EQP-NUM-BUF    TO EQUIP-NUM-P.
           MOVE EQP-EQUIP-NAME TO EQUIP-NAME-P.
           MOVE EQP-TYPE       TO TYPE-NUM-P.
           MOVE EQP-DEPT       TO DEPT-P.
           MOVE EQP-MAINT-ZONE TO ZONE-P.
           MOVE "5 "           TO PRIORITY-P.
           MOVE EQP-EXP-CLASS  TO EXP-CLASS-P.
           MOVE BUDGET-BUF     TO BUDGET-NO.
           MOVE EXPCLS-BUF     TO EXP-CLASS-P.
           MOVE REQST-BUF      TO REQUEST-NO.
           MOVE EQP-LOCATION   TO LOCATION-P.
           MOVE WO-DESC-BUF    TO DESCRIPTION-1-P.
           MOVE DESC-2-BUF     TO DESCRIPTION-2-1-P.
           MOVE DESC-3-BUF     TO DESCRIPTION-2-2-P.
           MOVE "AA"           TO WO-START-STATUS WO-TYPE-STATUS.
           MOVE PLNR-BUF       TO PLANNER-P.
           MOVE ENGR-BUF       TO ENGINEER-P.
           MOVE SCHD-BUF       TO SCHEDULER-P.
           MOVE JP-KEY-BUF     TO PM-JOBPLAN-KEY.
           MOVE MSTR-SCH-BUF   TO PM-SCHEDULE-KEY.

           CALL "TADDWOII"     USING DBPARAMETERS
                               STATUS-AREA
                               WO-PLANNED-DATA
                               CONDIT-CODE
                               ERROR-SWITCH.
           IF ERROR-SWITCH NOT = 0
               MOVE "DB-PUT"   TO DB-TYPE
               MOVE ERROR-SWITCH TO CON-WORD
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               DISPLAY DISP-DOTS
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "  PLEASE NOTIFY MMIS SYSTEM MANAGER OR"
               DISPLAY "  HP SYSTEM OPERATOR OF THE FOLLOWING:"
               DISPLAY "  PROGRAM NAME:  SPMWOGEN OF XPMMAINT"
               DISPLAY "  SUBROUTINE:    TADDWOII"
               DISPLAY "  " DB-ERROR
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY DISP-DOTS
               DISPLAY "    "
               MOVE SPACES     TO WO-ADD-SAVE
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           CALL "TWOTRACK"     USING WO-TRACK-DATA.
           PERFORM WRITE-AUDIT THRU WA-EXIT.
           GO TO 6-MAIN.

       65-CHECK-CC.
           MOVE "00"           TO FILE-STAT.
      *C**********************************************************************
      *C***  VALIDATION CHECK REMOVED PER NAPANEE/DANVILLE REQUEST OUT OF  ***
      *C***  THE PM SEMINAR IN NAPANEE OCT. 1992 - WDR  OCT. 19, 1992      ***
      *C**********************************************************************
      *    IF CC-KEY NOT = SPACES
      *        MOVE CC-KEY     TO PERCCNUM OF PER-PERSONNEL
      *        READ PER-PERSONNEL INTO PERSONNEL-DATA
      *            INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.

       WRITE-AUDIT.
           MOVE SPACES         TO  PM-AUDIT-DATA RETURN-ERROR.
           MOVE TODAYS-DATE    TO  AUDIT-DATE AUDIT-YRMO.
           ACCEPT TIME-BUF     FROM TIME.
           MOVE TIME-HHMM      TO  AUDIT-TIME.
           MOVE "OO"           TO  AUDIT-TRANS AUDIT-WO-STATUS.
           MOVE EQP-NUM-BUF    TO  AUDIT-EQUIP-NUM.
           MOVE WORK-ORDER-NUMBER
                               TO  AUDIT-WO-NUM.
           MOVE "  "           TO  AUDIT-PM-LEVEL-X.
           MOVE "MASTER PM WORKORDER CREATED   "
                               TO  AUDIT-DESC.

           CALL "SPMAUDIT"     USING PM-AUDIT-DATA
                               DBPARAMETERS
                               RETURN-ERROR.

       WA-EXIT.                EXIT.

       65-ERROR.
           MOVE B"1"           TO IND(99) IND(FIELD-NUMBER).

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE               DISPLAY-FILE.
           CLOSE               PM-JOBPLAN.
           CLOSE               PM-MSTR-SCHED.
           CLOSE               EQP-EQUIPMENT.
           CLOSE               MVALIDPLTDATA.
           CLOSE               PER-PERSONNEL.
           GOBACK.

       999-CATREAD.
           MOVE SPACES         TO CATREAD-MSG-TEXT.
           MOVE LANG-SETNUM    TO CATREAD-MSG-SET.
           MOVE LANG-MSGNUM    TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD"     USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NOT-FOUND
               MOVE "**CATREAD ERROR**" TO CATREAD-MSG-TEXT.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO ERRMSG.

       999-CATREAD-EXIT.       EXIT.

      *********************  END OF FILE  *************************
